      "side": 1,
      "message": "Can we please keep the API surface a little bit narrower. Instead of splitting into many functions, let\u0027s simply have sendQosSessionAvailable take an instance of QosSessionAttributes, and have the NetworkAgent code tell with instanceOf.\n\nThe main concern here is that this becomes precedent, and if we eventually have 10 different subclasses of QosSessionAttributes the API will have to be enlarged in consequence.\n\nYou can\u0027t do anything for the AIDLs, but if you can apply this in places like NetworkAgent it will save you some code duplication.",
